%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6a740502731dab025bdeccf416ca83a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: FirstTutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  <ShouldBlockInteraction>k__BackingField: 0
  <ChainType>k__BackingField: 1
  <Dialogues>k__BackingField:
  - <Message>k__BackingField: Alright kid, today is your first day as a spaceloop
      controller! Nothing too complicated, just make sure nothing crashes in orbit.
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: Right now the ships should be safe, but soon, more
      ships will approach!
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe40fe75d7474bf45aba5790721e8c11, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "To start the day, there won\u2019t be too many ships
      and satellites, so you can use that time to get acclimated."
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b4bbc7d15be8fb3418c68d09405fd50e, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: As the day goes on, more ships and satellites will
      request to join an orbit. When you get a request, click on the one you want
      to join and guide it to a safe orbit.
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 0}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: Remember, you can always adjust the view by right clicking
      and dragging around, and by using the mouse wheel to zoom in and out. Try it
      out to see if you can find the bottom of the planet!
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 1229d9a81f257254d9cb2e43ecd8b7b8, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: 'It can be helpful to use that to see where a new ship
      is coming from when you select one, and for making sure you have the best angle
      on your current system.

'
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b5b94519563f524aa7cb9f0658a1a7d, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: Each and every ship and satellite wants to be on a
      specific orbit. The preferred orbit will be highlighted in yellow both when
      you hover over one and when selecting one.
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe40fe75d7474bf45aba5790721e8c11, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "Ships will usually make you more money, but they\u2019ll
      leave orbit after a while. Satellites might make a little less, but they\u2019ll
      stay until something crashes into them."
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: fe40fe75d7474bf45aba5790721e8c11, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: If you make enough money, you can get some upgrades
      for the system that should help make managing the ships a bit easier, like
      more available orbits. Check the bottom right of your screen periodically to
      see if you can afford an upgrade.
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6b1cb82faed95ba4b87da762c903a1e8, type: 3}
  - <Message>k__BackingField: "Good luck out there kid, you\u2019re gonna need it."
    <IconOverride>k__BackingField: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5b5b94519563f524aa7cb9f0658a1a7d, type: 3}
